cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this implementation and the original NCM paper when using this project."
type: software
title: "Next-Concept Modeling for TPU"
authors:
  - family-names: Balensiefer
    given-names: Fabian
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
url: "https://github.com/fbalensiefer/Next-Concept-Modeling-for-TPU"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fbalensiefer/Next-Concept-Modeling-for-TPU"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A functional JAX/Flax implementation of multiscale residual vector
  quantization and shared level-wise parallel generation, with explicit EMA
  state and dp/fsdp sharding. CPU correctness tests are provided; TPU
  performance and model quality remain unmeasured. The underlying NCM method
  is due to Kumbong and colleagues.
keywords:
  - next-concept modeling
  - residual vector quantization
  - JAX
  - Flax
  - TPU
  - SPMD
